---
source: crates/acpilot-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout(&top)
---
Edit and run ACP agents over one daemon

Usage: acpilot [COMMAND]

Commands:
  version  Print version and protocol information
  ext      Install, verify, and approve extensions
  secret   Store, list, and remove credentials in the OS keyring
  tui      Open the terminal UI against a running daemon
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
